      "reason": "Opsgenie's incident API reference documents Get Associated Alerts, GET /v1/incidents/:identifier/associated-alert-ids with identifierType, offset, direction, limit and order, answering the ids of the alerts linked to the incident; the pinned document, last changed on 2021-02-19, declares no path containing associated."
